Description: CVE-2026-6471 - Restrict logical decoding plugins via output_plugin_libraries
 Missing authorization allowed a non-superuser with REPLICATION privilege
 to dlopen an arbitrary library as a logical decoding plugin. Introduce
 output_plugin_libraries (default pgoutput, test_decoding) as a whitelist.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/postgres/postgres/commit/bf3842a64f5df489fab31b82aaeb9067ac938fde
Author: Jacob Champion <jchampion@postgresql.org>
Last-Update: 2026-08-21

