Description: CVE-2026-14668 - Be more wary about constant's datatype in scalarineqsel().
 The special case for estimating conditions involving a ctid column failed
 to check that the RHS constant is of type tid. A maliciously constructed
 operator could provide a user-controlled Datum value, risking SIGSEGV or
 server memory disclosure. Guard the ctid special case by additionally
 requiring the constant's type to be TIDOID before treating constval as an
 ItemPointer.
 .
