Description: CVE-2026-14680 - Reject SQL calls to functions taking/returning type internal, and return NULL honestly from numeric aggregate combine functions
 PostgreSQL allowed SQL-level callers to invoke functions and operators
 whose declared argument or result type is the pseudo-type "internal",
 and to request casts to or from "internal". Because "internal" values
 are really C pointers, this let an attacker pass an arbitrary integer as
 a pointer and dereference it, potentially crashing the server or reading
 server memory.
 .
 This backport combines two dependent upstream commits:
 .
 1. Parent (8f7e35b08ad5b5a400d0333188c17bb354174f60): lock down the
    function/operator call syntax and the cast machinery so that neither
    an argument nor a result of type internal can be reached from SQL,
    and so that casts to/from internal are rejected. The checks are added
    in the parser (parse_func.c, parse_oper.c), the coercion pathway
    (parse_coerce.c) and the plpgsql I/O-coercion fallback (pl_exec.c).
 .
 2. Child (1aa601b4f55e337f1c8d19757129815f1685cac): make the numeric
    aggregate "combine" functions return SQL NULL when both transition
    states are NULL, instead of returning a NULL pointer typed as
    internal. Without this a strict internal-accepting function could
    still receive a null pointer via parallel aggregation.
 .
 Backport notes for PostgreSQL 13 (REL_13_23): the numeric.c leg applies
 to numeric_combine, numeric_avg_combine, numeric_poly_combine and
 int8_avg_combine. The upstream child commit also touched
 interval_avg_combine in timestamp.c, but PostgreSQL 13 uses the older
 array-based interval average transition state (function interval_combine
 with transition type _interval, not the pointer/internal-based
 IntervalAggState introduced in PostgreSQL 14). That code path never
 exposes a NULL internal pointer, so the timestamp.c hunk is intentionally
 omitted as not applicable to this branch.
Origin: upstream, https://github.com/postgres/postgres/commit/8f7e35b08ad5b5a400d0333188c17bb354174f60
